<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia M3 money supply up 35.3 percent in November.</title>
<headline>Zambia M3 money supply up 35.3 percent in November.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's broadly defined M3 money supply rose by 35.3 year-on-year, the central bank said.</p>
<p>M3 (million kwacha)    Nov 1996	 Oct 1996	  Nov 1995</p>
<p>			     562,020.6	554,602.5	 415,521.2</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom + 260-1-222689</p>
</text>
